HealthChecks.description:
Each check: the database, the workers, the oldest overdue timer and job (seconds;
`null`: nothing overdue), and whether ffmpeg and ffprobe (video posters and probes) are
there (`missing` never changes the status).

QualityStatusValue.description:
FR-PROF-16's quality statuses. ``certified``: a certification matches the fingerprint;
``uncertified``: none ever has (every configuration in M3); ``stale``: the matching one was
invalidated since (by a canary eval below a floor, or by drift).
